{{/*
  import — one row per step of an import, streamed as it happens.

  A hundred-megabyte bundle takes long enough that silence reads as failure,
  so the answer is a stream of rows rather than one answer at the end, each
  flushed as it happens and appended to the region (the `import` partial
  target swaps beforeend). The region itself is empty on a first paint and is
  rendered by the shell; the same template renders one row when the handler
  writes one.
*/}}
{{define "import"}}{{if .Rows}}{{range .Rows}}<p class="import-row" data-state="{{.State}}">{{.Detail}}</p>
{{end}}{{else}}<section id="atlas-import" class="import-rows" aria-live="polite"></section>
{{end}}{{end}}
